<section class="nominate">
  <div class="nominate__main">
    <h1>Nominate an inductee</h1>
    <p>We need your help! If you know someone who should be in the Hall of Fame — a standout athlete, a coach who shaped a program, a team that made history — tell us about them below. The form goes straight to the committee, and you do not need to fill in everything: a name and roughly when they competed is enough for us to start looking.</p>
    <div class="nominate__form-wrap">
      <iframe src="{{ site.googleFormUrl }}" width="100%" height="900" frameborder="0">Loading form…</iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
  <aside class="nominate__aside">
    <div class="panel panel--dark">
      <h3>Eligibility</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Five years removed from Smithville High School</li>
        <li>Athletes, coaches, whole teams and contributors are all eligible</li>
        <li>Posthumous nominations are welcome</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <h3>What evidence helps</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Newspaper clippings, yearbook pages, programs</li>
        <li>Records, championships, all-conference or all-state honors</li>
        <li>Names of teammates or coaches we can ask</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>
